---
title: Caipirinha
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, cachaca]
source: Classic cocktail, number 33 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Cut half a @lime{0.5} into wedges and muddle them in a #rocks glass{} with @superfine sugar{2%tsp} to press out the juice and the oil in the skin. Add @cachaça{2%fl_oz}, fill with crushed ice, and stir well. Serve with the lime still in the glass.
